      "content": "When you feel that constant, heavy hum, it can feel like nothing you do makes a difference. Please remember that the feeling of being a burden is often a symptom of deep exhaustion, not a reflection of your actual worth. Even small moments of self-compassion count, and it is okay to simply exist without needing to constantly \"fix\" everything. If these feelings become too much, please reach out to a crisis line or mental health professional who is equipped to help carry some of this weight with you.",
