      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is absolutely not weird; the energy it takes just to function when facing such deep struggle is enormous and incredibly draining. That persistent battle to just exist is a profound form of exhaustion. When the fight feels endless, the desire for quiet and stillness is completely understandable. Please know that finding peace doesn't have to mean completing a giant overhaul; sometimes it means finding tiny, manageable pockets of rest right now.",
      "source": "target",
